<title>CHINA: C.Lyonnais to set warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais to set warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Monday it intended to issue up to 43 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$64.50     PREMIUM	  18.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$1.1739    GEARING	  5.49x</p>
<p> MATURITY	   10 MTHS	PAYMENT DATE   TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG    LISTING DATE   TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$64.50     BOARD LOT	10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		 CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT THE</p>
<p>			DISCRETION OF THE ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
